211305400618_1426166590482501018_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C-RcvCkXsRUQ7kNvwGgFqAs&_nc_oc=AdpYMIkEXD2v5fJ8_4O44GcNJa24eeJlZHYbGZZ_CYnpJeFT3r-8aGFz7DzZ1gQpAXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdy4ugVGsuVgd_8MxbOqvh0E1VXYrTwQ_xzF3-s7jKmQ&oe=6AF3355D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_03.png", "id": "925950811477697", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75196225_925950814811030_4585030413770382015_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Am4oUhb2CEQ7kNvwEjFYhL&_nc_oc=AdrH7-eqfC9Ux9X4ceX7PfSOYALSUvkrAmJltiGY5AQ6uY88q0J34B0OlzgZEgutX-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_Zl7V714xBA9fH8KReDfrq1V4LK2BrWr_VjwWVtkzyw&oe=6AF33477"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1 - Home 2560x1440 - FEAR.png", "id": "978988061298543", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623551_978988064631876_9173006316961834963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FXpGU1T6bOIQ7kNvwH8TPho&_nc_oc=Adr2kSk4nHjI0evSqqxDPBk_Dfg0yEo3h8ZibXfyAcP47q9VH5MAHh4LkY22uqvcpg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcRr0G8WwiVXXkxOCimsT9v4X2YrXrmGaI09iONhR5ww&oe=6AF34B69"}, "display_name": "LIMINAL: Relax. Unwind. Engage. Explore.", "keywords": ["entertainment", "relax", "calm", "meditation", "fun"], "long_description": "**EXPLORE LIMINAL: 155+ Experiences to WOW you and Transform your Mood.**\n\nGet Liminal now and try it out for FREE!\n\nSeven categories to explore. Over 1 Million in app five-star ratings!\n\n**NEW: The Fear Arena is open. Safe scares, big feelings and a lot of fun.**\n{1607277817804674}\n\nMake sure you try **Samsara** in the Awe Arena\n{1040915533978887}\n\nReduce anxiety, meditate, breathe or grab a pillow to lie down and sleep. Try hypnosis to distract you from pain and reduce stress. \n{1208055313831116}\n\nPlay exciting casual games and other interactive content. Liminal is much more than a mindfulness app:\n{828649595813485}\n\n**Experience Awe. Find Relief. Enhance your Focus. Face your Fears.**\n\nLiminal is a great way to chill out and have some fun!\n\nSubscribe for unlimited access. Or enjoy a weekly rotation of FREE experiences. \n\n- \"Incredible, Beautiful, and Jaw Dropping\u201d\n- \u201cAmazing and relaxing!\u201d\n- \u201cMakes the oculus worth it\u201d\n\nDesigned with neuroscientists and psychologists and a community of partners.  \n\nTake your first steps and try **Cyberpunch, Hypnosis, Iris** and more!\n\nThere is always plenty to try with Liminal!", "short_description": "155+ experiences to WOW you and transform your mood. Try our extensive catalog for FREE!\n\nNEW: The Fear Arena is open. Safe scares, big feelings and a lot of fun.\n\nSeven categories to explore. Over 1m in app five-star ratings!\n\nExperience Awe. Find Relief. Enhance your Focus. Face your Fears.\n\nLiminal is a great way to chill out and have fun!\n\nSubscribe for unlimited access. Or enjoy a free weekly rotation  of experiences. \n\nDesigned with neuroscientists and psychologists and content partners."}]}, "developer_name": "Liminal VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminalvr.com/privacy-statement/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://liminalvr.com/terms-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Liminal VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://liminalvr.com/liminal-platform/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["CASUAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_proces